  "name": "Stellar Crown Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Stellar Crown prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 31 August–1 September and 7–8 September 2024, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Stellar Crown booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Stellar Crown logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Ledian and Bouffalant, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
